html(lang="en")
  include ../partials/_header.pug
  body
    include ../partials/_nav.pug
    
    .main
      .work-hero
        h1 Art & comics
          //- .hero-tag Comic
          .hero-icon
            img(src='../img/icon--eos.png' alt='Eggs on Sale icon')
        .work-hero-desc Digital illustration and more

      p In my free time I moonlight as a digital artist, often posting on social media or other sites. From time to time I also work a bit of illustration into my day job, when the conditions allow. I've published two comic series with modest followings, one of which has been featured on the home pages of two of the biggest comic platforms.

      p Currently, however, I focus more on an alternate handle/account that does more fanart illustrations and comics (with a touch a game-dev on the side). That handle will remain private, however, but it has proved much more successful and even viral at times.

      p Below are a few snippets of shareable stuff, including some panels I drew for an earlier version of this portfolio site.
      
      figure.img-group
        img(src='/img/img--art-1.png' alt='a mock home screen for TRAILS, with illustration as the background')
        figcaption.annotation A splash screen I mocked up for TRAILS, back when I was ideating what a brand refresh could look and feel like
      
      figure.img-group
        img(src='/img/img--art-2.png' alt='an illustration mockup for TRAILS showing three kids holding a glowing orb')
        figcaption.annotation An older illustration mockup for TRAILS programming

      figure.img-group
        img(src='/img/img--comic-1.png' alt='')
        figcaption.annotation How it felt being a lead on IBM Bluemine, following panels related
      
      figure.img-group
        img(src='/img/img--comic-2.png' alt='')

      figure.img-group
        img(src='/img/img--comic-3.png' alt='')
      
      figure.img-group
        img(src='/img/img--comic-4.png' alt='')
          
      .prev-next
        a.prev-button(href='agency')
          span.prev-next-button__label PREV
          span.prev-next-button__text Agency work
          
